  {
    q: 'Does parging help protect against water?',
    a: 'Yes. A sound parge coat sheds surface water and pairs with our waterproofing services to protect concrete foundations from water damage. For active leaks, we will tell you honestly whether waterproofing is the real fix.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can you repair old, flaking parging?',
    a: 'Yes. We remove the loose, failing material, prep the surface properly and apply a fresh coat. If the old coat is letting go across most of the wall, a full removal and recoat lasts far longer than chasing patches.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What time of year can you parge?',
    a: 'Roughly spring through late fall, whenever temperatures stay above freezing while the coat cures. If you spot damage over the winter, get your quote in early and we will book the first workable weather.',
  },
